-- (weapons_autocannons.lua's header / plan.md §0). Where the reference lists a
-- single shared name, the entry keeps one `name` and no `faction_names`;
-- where it has no launcher at all (its Line Systems page is empty), the
-- earlier original scheme is retained.
--   Patrol  general -> HD-70 "Lightning" / Type B "Bereaver"  (two names)
--           anti-capital (fills our nuclear slot) -> HD-96 "Nova" (shared;
--                      the reference's specialized anti-capital light
